/Title (Robust\040control\040for\040line\055of\055sight\040stabilization\040of\040a\040two\055axis\040gimbal\040system)
/Author (þÿ\000M\000e\000h\000m\000e\000t\000\040\000B\000a\000s\000k\000i\000n\000\054\000\040\000M\000e\000h\000m\000e\000t\000\040\000K\000e\000m\000a\000l\000\040\000L\000e\000b\000l\000e\000b\000i\000c\000i\000o\001\037\000l\000u)
/Subject (Line\055of\055sight\040stabilization\040against\040various\040disturbances\040is\040an\040essential\040property\040of\040gimbaled\040imaging\040systems\040mounted\040on\040mobile\040platforms\056\040In\040recent\040years\054\040the\040importance\040of\040target\040detection\040from\040higher\040distances\040has\040increased\056\040This\040has\040raised\040the\040need\040for\040better\040stabilization\040performance\056\040For\040that\040reason\054\040stabilization\040loops\040are\040designed\040such\040that\040they\040have\040higher\040gains\040and\040larger\040bandwidths\056\040As\040these\040are\040required\040for\040good\040disturbance\040attenuation\054\040sufficient\040loop\040stability\040is\040also\040needed\056\040However\054\040model\040uncertainties\040around\040structural\040resonances\040impose\040strict\040restrictions\040on\040sufficient\040loop\040stability\056\040Therefore\054\040to\040satisfy\040high\040stabilization\040performance\040in\040the\040presence\040of\040model\040uncertainties\054\040robust\040control\040methods\040are\040required\056\040In\040this\040paper\054\040a\040robust\040controller\040design\040in\040LQG\057LTR\054\040H\044\137\173\134infty\040\175\044\054\040and\040\044\134mu\040\044\055synthesis\040framework\040is\040described\040for\040a\040two\055axis\040gimbal\056\040First\054\040the\040performance\040criteria\040and\040weights\040are\040determined\040to\040minimize\040the\040stabilization\040error\040with\040moderate\040control\040effort\040under\040known\040platform\040disturbance\040profile\056\040Second\054\040model\040uncertainties\040are\040determined\040by\040considering\040locally\040linearized\040models\040at\040different\040operating\040points\056\040Next\054\040robust\040LQG\057LTR\054\040H\044\137\173\134infty\040\175\044\054\040and\040\044\134mu\040\044\040controllers\040are\040designed\056\040Robust\040stability\040and\040performance\040of\040the\040three\040designs\040are\040investigated\040and\040compared\056\040The\040paper\040finishes\040with\040the\040experimental\040performances\040to\040validate\040the\040designed\040robust\040controllers\056)
/Keywords (01\040Oct\0402017\054\040Turkish\040Journal\040of\040Electrical\040Engineering\040and\040Computer\040Sciences\054\040Robust\040control\054\040Linear\055quadratic\055Gaussian\040control)
